node.text:
Hah! Sure are! I knew yah couldn't resist, ya' softshells are just so strange!

Ya know w'at, 'ere. Next time you see a shell that strokes them 'love-chords', of yours, just spritz a little bit of this on'ye self before ya say hello!

{{yellow|*Ditzy-Fly gives you several winks with their many eyes. Before handing you a vial of strangely flourescent liquid.*}}
